      "content": "hm, okay, i get the \"trend\" thing. but im worried the investors are gonna be sharks. if they see 'compelling trend' they might just dig for the actual significance level. if we don't want to lie but we also can't afford to lose this funding, is there any way we can present it as a win without explicitly saying it hit the p < 0.05 mark? like, how do we make them walk away thinking the data is solid?",
